  "decision_rationale": "Out-of-sample evaluation on the 2023-2024 partition demonstrates hypothesis failure under quantitative governance. Overall win rate collapsed from 54.46% in-sample to 43.82% out-of-sample (39W / 50L, two-sided binomial p = 0.2872). Severe directional collapse occurred on Short trades (PF 0.633, 27.03% win rate, -$41.933/oz net loss). The primary net expectancy 95% bootstrap confidence interval [-0.855, +2.299]/oz spans zero, failing statistical significance. Furthermore, forensic analysis revealed that all positive net PnL was generated by 4 trades where missing 11:55 UTC bars erroneously caused positions to hold past daily rollover until evening (LAST_AVAILABLE_BAR_EXIT). When strictly capped at 12:00 UTC, out-of-sample net PnL is -$24.218/oz. The hypothesis fails to establish a robust, statistically verifiable edge."
